  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">a senior technical advisor to the World Alliance for Breastfeeding Action (WABA)The purpose of recruiting a senior technical advisor from IMCH, Uppsala University is to strengthen the resource capacity of the WABA Network and WABA Secretariat in terms  of programme scientific expertise. The WABA programmes address mater nal and child health issues.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">technical advisor&apos;s experience of working closer to the WABA programmes for three years will therefore also enhance the capacity of IMCH&apos;s own research and education programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
